 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/84d8fe16826860e6acb2fac36bd8715c.webm?t=1769310232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/84d8fe16826860e6acb2fac36bd8715c.mp4?t=1769310232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/dfcba36ad3b3b15afb6d0fe6164d691e.poster.avif?t=1769310232\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/dfcba36ad3b3b15afb6d0fe6164d691e.webm?t=1769310232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/dfcba36ad3b3b15afb6d0fe6164d691e.mp4?t=1769310232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>The Gallop of Legend: Diverse Combat Mechanics</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey isn't limited to traveling on foot. Experience the thrill of charging through enemy camps on horseback or engaging in intense aerial combat. These varied gameplay mechanics ensure a fresh experience throughout your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/ca78bb7f0c8525ba35e6767aeeabdb34.poster.avif?t=1769310232\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/ca78bb7f0c8525ba35e6767aeeabdb34.webm?t=1769310232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/ca78bb7f0c8525ba35e6767aeeabdb34.mp4?t=1769310232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><spa